Maintainer: Serhiy Morenko
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: NetBird as a GL.iNet WireGuard client profile.
 Runs NetBird in its own network namespace behind a local WireGuard server, and
 adds a "NetBird" profile to the GL.iNet VPN client so every GL.iNet VPN feature
 (per-device and per-domain policy, kill switch, VPN dashboard) applies to it.
